      "content": "but is it really that dangerous tho? like if i take like 3000mg for just 10 days it shouldn't actually cause a stone right away, it's just a vitamin. i'm pretty sure my body can handle it if it's just for a short time to get my energy up and clear out some junk. what's the worst that could happen?",
